cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Object Proximity Analysis"
type: software
abstract: >-
  ImageJ/Fiji plugin for calibrated distances between segmented objects in
  2D and 3D label images or ROI sets (centre to centre, centre to edge, edge
  to centre, edge to edge and surface contact, for every directed pair of up
  to five channels), with 2D spatial point-pattern statistics (Ripley's K
  and L, nearest-neighbour G, pair correlation and their cross-type forms)
  and reproducible Monte Carlo tests against complete spatial randomness.
